			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2137079">
									

<p>This article includes a lot of stuff that isn't mine.</p>
<ul>
<li>The first image is from <a href="http://imgur.com/LNW8hXB">samuirai</a> on reddit.</li>
<li>2nd image by Roger Ballen, called <em>Head Inside Shirt</em>, from his book <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Shadow Chamber</span>. Website found <a href="http://www.rogerballen.com/image-gallery/shadow-chamber-images">here</a>. Permission was requested and received to use this.</li>
<li>Music by Riverman, remix of &quot;Whisperlude&quot; by Pogo. <em>Download the entire song <a href="https://rivermanmusic.bandcamp.com/track/pogo-whisperlude-riverman-remix">here</a></em>, or his 4 other remixes <a href="https://rivermanmusic.bandcamp.com/album/pogo-remixes-ep">here</a>, and see all of Pogo's work on his <a href="https://soundcloud.com/pogomix">soundcloud</a> or <a href="http://pogomix.net/">site</a>. Permission also recieved by Riverman.</li>
<li>Also, the song lyrics are based off the tune of &quot;<a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tBkkplOiSjQ">Lakehouse</a>&quot; by Of Monsters and Men. Don't try to sing along, I've edited it to avoid the repetition already prominent in the original song.</li>
</ul>
<p>Thanks to Eskobar, Roget, Von Pincier, TwistedGears, and Zolgamax for feedback. Also, this is the prequel to <a href="/scp-1530">SCP-1530</a>.</p>

